20:["$","figure",null,{"className":"page-visual page-visual--inline","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/images/application-writing-1280.webp","srcSet":"/images/application-writing-640.webp 640w, /images/application-writing-1280.webp 1280w","sizes":"(max-width: 860px) calc(100vw - 32px), 440px","width":1280,"height":853,"alt":"Illustrative student writing application notes beside a laptop","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":"Illustrative editorial image; not a photograph identifying a particular university."}]]}]
21:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-Qualification examples from the linked minimum matrix",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Qualification examples from the linked minimum matrix"}],[["$","p","The matrix linked by METU’s office is dated 5 January 2024. It lists SAT total 1,200, with Maths 700 for engineering, architecture and specified science programmes; ACT 27; and IB diploma 33 with a relevant HL subject. These are dated minimum examples, not newly announced 2027 cut-offs.",{"children":"The matrix linked by METU’s office is dated 5 January 2024. It lists SAT total 1,200, with Maths 700 for engineering, architecture and specified science programmes; ACT 27; and IB diploma 33 with a relevant HL subject. These are dated minimum examples, not newly announced 2027 cut-offs."}],["$","p","The office says its decisions are holistic and quota-based. Use the entire qualification list for your country and programme, and check whether a newer matrix has replaced it. Do not select the easiest isolated number without the subject conditions.",{"children":"The office says its decisions are holistic and quota-based. Use the entire qualification list for your country and programme, and check whether a newer matrix has replaced it. Do not select the easiest isolated number without the subject conditions."}],["$","p","Original case: a student meets the SAT total but not the specified mathematics minimum for engineering. The total alone does not meet that matrix route. They need an accepted alternative or an improved result before treating the requirement as satisfied.",{"children":"Original case: a student meets the SAT total but not the specified mathematics minimum for engineering. The total alone does not meet that matrix route. They need an accepted alternative or an improved result before treating the requirement as satisfied."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://iso.metu.edu.tr/en/system/files/odtu_iso_requirements.pdf",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://iso.metu.edu.tr/en/system/files/odtu_iso_requirements.pdf","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"METU linked minimum qualification matrix"}]]}],["$","span","https://iso.metu.edu.tr/en/node/37",{"children":[" · ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://iso.metu.edu.tr/en/node/37","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"METU qualification and evaluation explanation"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","2-English: an important IELTS restriction",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"English: an important IELTS restriction"}],[["$","p","METU’s English page states that instruction is in English and that submitting an English result is not compulsory for the undergraduate application. Admitted students without accepted evidence may take the METU English Proficiency Exam and, if necessary, attend preparation.",{"children":"METU’s English page states that instruction is in English and that submitting an English result is not compulsory for the undergraduate application. Admitted students without accepted evidence may take the METU English Proficiency Exam and, if necessary, attend preparation."}],["$","p","The same official page says IELTS tests taken on or after 24 December 2022 are no longer accepted. A generic guide saying “IELTS accepted” misses that restriction. Check the current equivalence table for recognised evidence and scores before paying for a language test.",{"children":"The same official page says IELTS tests taken on or after 24 December 2022 are no longer accepted. A generic guide saying “IELTS accepted” misses that restriction. Check the current equivalence table for recognised evidence and scores before paying for a language test."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$L25","$undefined"]}],"$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29"]}]
